Framework Laptop features completely modular, repairable design with replaceable hard drives, memory, WiFi modules, batteries, and keyboard using industry-standard sockets. Devices include pull-tabs, captive fasteners, QR-coded guides, and single necessary tool, minimizing disassembly friction. Made from 50% post-consumer recycled aluminum and 30% recycled plastic in fully recyclable packaging, Framework enables customer self-repair, reduces refurbishment complexity, and extends device lifespan through upgradeable components rather than enforced obsolescence.